WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.240
These are all characters with bounties over
1 billion berries in One Piece as of the latest

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:10.040
chapters of the manga, how they got their
respective bounty and whether they actually

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.059
deserve it or not.

00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:17.240
At the bottom of the list of the most valuable
pirates in One Piece is Jack, the drought,

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:20.100
third commander of the beast pirates.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:25.699
Jack is a giant fishman that has eaten the
ancient mammoth zoan devil fruit with incredible

00:00:25.699 --> 00:00:27.440
physical power and endurance.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:33.310
He was known for his cruel and brutal methods
like the gas attack and Torture he conducted

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.380
on Zou, the island of the minks.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:40.540
He is fiercely loyal to his captain Kaido
and was willing to die for him during the

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:46.660
raid on onigashima, where he took on the elite
force of the minks in their sulong form.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:52.580
For both his power and his brutal nature,
Jack earned a bounty of exactly 1 Billion

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:57.620
berries, just making the cut for this exclusive
club of pirates.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:01.480
Since he got defeated during the battle for
Wano and the beast pirates got captured with

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:08.010
the situation of their captain unknown, Jack's
bounty might actually be reduced.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:13.000
Nonetheless he has proven to us, why he is
in the 1 billion club.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:18.910
Just above Jack is Vinsmoke Sanji, the first
of 4 straw hat pirates on this list and the

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:21.080
official cook of the crew.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:26.070
Sanji has proven his worth and strength as
a member of a new Yonko crew over and over

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.070
again.

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:32.060
Sanji has grown incredibly strong as a fighter,
unlocking the abilities of his Vinsmoke DNA

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:36.360
over the course of Wano on top of his fire
abilities.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:40.770
He can do sky walk and has some of the best
observation haki in the crew.

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:47.300
He managed to take down Queen, Kaido's second
commander and help Luffy reach the status

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:54.650
of 1,032,000,000 berries, putting him in the
top 20 of highest bounties in the story, which

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:57.799
I think is more than justified.

00:01:57.799 --> 00:02:02.320
Next is Charlotte Katakuri, first commander
of the Big Mom pirates.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:07.470
Katakuri has basically been leading the Yonko
crew whenever Big Mom was on one of her hunger

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:08.470
pains.

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:14.240
Like most first commanders, he enjoys incredible
respect throughout the pirate world and has

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:20.060
incredibly advanced observation haki abilities,
so far only shared by the likes of Luffy and

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:23.900
Kaido, that allow him to look slightly into
the future.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:30.250
He has excellent control over his incredibly
powerful devil fruit and excellent leadership

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.250
skills.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:35.810
His defeat by Luffy was only due to his sense
of honour and his willingness to let Luffy

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:38.830
grow and evolve during their fight.

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:43.720
Despite his defeat, he is a true force to
be reckoned with and the second strongest

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:51.050
fighter among the big mom pirates, earning
him rightfully a 1,057,000,000 berry bounty.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:56.520
With Katakuri in between, after Sanji, we
have two more Straw hat pirates in a row.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:02.220
First is Jinbe, former warlord of the sea
and helmsman of the straw hat pirates.

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:05.530
Next to jack he is the only other fishman
on this list.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:10.820
Not only was Jinbe an equal among the likes
of Mihawk, Doflamingo and Boa Hancock, he

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:16.670
is also the most powerful user of the legendary
art of fishman karate.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:22.010
He is able to use and manipulate the forces
of the ocean and fight under water like no

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.010
one else.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:28.650
This would be a great feat by itself, but
in a world of powerful devil fruit users,

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:34.560
who are weak against sea water, he is a truly
powerful weapon for his captain.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:40.250
Put on the deepest level of impel down and
now part of emperor luffy's crew, Jinbe has

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:45.430
more than earned his impressive bounty off
1,100,000,000 berries.

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:52.580
Just a bit ahead of him is another straw hat,
Luffy's second in command and contender for

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:57.739
the title of the strongest swordsman in the
world, Roronoa zoro.

00:03:57.739 --> 00:04:01.910
No one doubts that Luffy's right hand man
belongs on this list.

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:04.319
If anything he ranks to low here.

00:04:04.319 --> 00:04:08.670
Zoro has been close to luffy's equal in power
throughout the story.

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:14.140
Not only has he been acknowledged and trained
by the strongest swordsman in the world, Dracule

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:18.199
Mihawk, but he also is a yielder of Conquerers
haki.

00:04:18.199 --> 00:04:24.020
Zoro has been growing stronger and more terrifying
as a fighter throughout the entire story,

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:29.440
always willing to sacrifice his life for his
honour as a swordsman and the safety of his

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.440
crew.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:34.860
He is fiercely loyal to Luffy and closely
resembles the relationship between Silvers

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:37.090
Rayleigh and Gol D. Roger.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:43.879
After escaping death, cutting Kaido, the strongest
creature in the world and taking down King,

00:04:43.879 --> 00:04:50.449
Zoro has more than earned his 1,111,000,000
bounty.

00:04:50.449 --> 00:04:56.189
Making a bit of a jump of over 200 million
berries, we have the 3 remaining yonko commanders

00:04:56.189 --> 00:05:02.020
on this list, starting out with Queen the
Plague, second commander of the beast pirates.

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:06.830
Like everyone else in the higher echelons
of the crew, Queen also wields a powerful

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:12.139
ancient zoan devil fruit, that they have modified
with cyborg technology.

00:05:12.139 --> 00:05:16.849
Not only are they an incredible powerful fighter,
but they also have incredible technological

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:21.720
and scientific knowledge, on the level of
Sanji's father Judge Vinsmoke or Caesar Clown.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:24.830
He is known for his love for torture and cruelty.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:30.699
However he has been portrayed as more of a
comic character throughout the wano Kuni arc.

00:05:30.699 --> 00:05:38.300
Maybe his bounty is a bit high, but his 1,320,000,000
berries are still reasonable.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:45.259
On rank 15 we have one of the coolest characters
in the story with one of the best devil fruits.

00:05:45.259 --> 00:05:50.660
Marco the Phoenix, first commander and doctor
of the Whitebeard pirates.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:55.560
Marco has fought against the most powerful
people in the one piece world and always made

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:58.740
it out alive and with little to no damage.

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:03.669
He fought the admirals at marineford, Blackbeard
and his men during the payback war and of

00:06:03.669 --> 00:06:07.190
course Big Mom as well as Kaido's commanders.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:10.869
And we don't even know who else.

00:06:10.869 --> 00:06:16.220
Marco is not only incredibly smart, but has
possibly the most useful Devil fruit in the

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:17.689
story.

00:06:17.689 --> 00:06:23.099
His mythical phoenix fruit not only gives
him great attack power and the ability to

00:06:23.099 --> 00:06:29.189
fly, but also gives him the properties of
a logia fruit plus strong healing abilities.

00:06:29.189 --> 00:06:33.879
Like a Phoenix, Marco seems almost impossible
to kill and is able to heal large groups of

00:06:33.879 --> 00:06:37.520
people during battle, as he proved during
the battle on Onigashima.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:44.749
If anything his 1,374,000,000 berries almost
seem too low.

00:06:44.749 --> 00:06:50.669
Especially since one place above him sits
King, who faced off against Marco together

00:06:50.669 --> 00:06:51.860
whit queen.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:55.499
Nonetheless King of course deserves a place
on this list.

00:06:55.499 --> 00:06:58.029
He is Kaido's right hand man.

00:06:58.029 --> 00:07:02.349
A swordsman who has also eaten a winged ancient
devil fruit.

00:07:02.349 --> 00:07:06.929
This is almost a little wasted on King however,
as he has wings of his own.

00:07:06.929 --> 00:07:11.949
As possibly the last surviving member of the
Lunarian race, the former gods who lived on

00:07:11.949 --> 00:07:18.300
top of the red line, King possesses incredible
powers including the ability to naturally

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.309
generate fire.

00:07:20.309 --> 00:07:25.649
While he just barely lost to zoro during Wano,
it's not hard to see how this man who stood

00:07:25.649 --> 00:07:31.520
side by side with Kaido would have gotten
his 1,390,000,000 berry bounty.

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:38.249
And with this, the remaining characters are
part of one of 3 groups, former warloards,

00:07:38.249 --> 00:07:42.119
part of the worst generation or a yonko.

00:07:42.119 --> 00:07:46.459
Starting with place 13 and the pirate empress
boa Hancock.

00:07:46.459 --> 00:07:50.990
Hancock not only is the leader of the Kuja
pirates, a tribe of legendary female warriors

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:57.509
living on Amazon Lilly, but she also is one
of the few confirmed people who can use conquerers

00:07:57.509 --> 00:07:58.509
haki.

00:07:58.509 --> 00:08:02.610
On top of that, she wields one of the most
powerful devil fruits in the story, that is

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:06.889
able to turn anyone with strong emotions for
her into stone.

00:08:06.889 --> 00:08:12.520
An ability so powerful , that Blackbeard wanted
to get his hands on it no matter what.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:17.189
Hancock has held herself against a number
of powerful enemies and survived the horrors

00:08:17.189 --> 00:08:20.129
of slavery at the hands of the celestial dragons.

00:08:20.129 --> 00:08:28.319
With the warlord system abolished her new
1,659,000,000 berry bounty shows how powerful

00:08:28.319 --> 00:08:32.890
luffy's self-declared future wife truly is.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:38.430
Next in line is another former warlord of
the sea that has just made his comeback into

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.650
the main story.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:46.460
Sir Crocodile, founder and commander of the
newly founded cross guild organisation.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:51.640
Crocodile not only managed to bring an entire
country under his control in Alabasta, but

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:56.970
he also is experienced in leading powerful
organisation, like the Baroque works together

00:08:56.970 --> 00:09:03.930
with Nico robin and now an even more powerful
one together with Dracule Mihawk.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:08.640
Crocodile was not afraid to face Whitbeard
or Akainu during the marineford war and apparently

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.880
has grown a lot stronger.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:17.750
His new bounty of 1,965,000,000 berries seems
quite high, considering that he lost to a

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:24.150
Luffy with no haki abilities yet, but I'm
very excited for him to show us why he deserves

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:27.780
the 12th highest bounty in the story.

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:32.630
Now however, we not only break into the top
10 of the list, but we also make a jump of

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:37.340
over 1 billion berries Into the 3 billions.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:43.510
Sharing places 9, 10 and 11 are 3 members
of the worst generation, all with exactly

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:44.510
3 billion berries.

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:49.410
Monkey D. Luffy, Trafalgar D Law and Eustass
Captain Kid.

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:55.030
These three were already protrayed as rivals
and roughly equals during the sabaody archipelago

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.030
arc.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:10:02.140
Now the trio has teamed up to take down two
of the former emperors, Big Mom and Kaido.

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:08.470
Kid has an incredibly powerful magnet devil
fruit ability combined with a crazy blood

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:13.310
lust, a darker version of Luffy, that was
able to stand his ground against the Yonko

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:15.400
with his brute force.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:22.150
He even tried attacking shanks before, where
he lost an arm and has only been growing stronger.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:28.930
Law meanwhile has one of the, if not THE most
valuable devil fruit there is, the op op no

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:34.860
mi, that not only has incredibly fighting
abilities, but that also is capable of granting

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.120
immortality.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:41.530
Law is incredibly intelligent and truly shines
as a supporting fighter in combination with

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:44.410
a brawler like Luffy or Kid.

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:48.460
I personally find both their bounties a little
too high.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:52.960
Yes, they took down big mom and I understand
that Eiichiro Oda wanted to underline the

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:59.280
rivalry between the three captains, but I
think a bounty sightly below Luffy would have

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:00.710
been more reasonable.

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:04.880
After all he fought Kaido alone, while these
two teamed up.

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:08.130
Nonetheless they belong on this list without
any question.

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:13.250
Luffy on the other hand as the captain of
the straw hat pirates and protagonist of the

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:17.350
story has been earning his bounty from day
one.

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:21.100
He has changed the one piece world, like almost
no one else.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:26.760
He has taken down the most powerful creature
in the world and awakened his legendary Sun

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:28.900
God Devil fruit during the fight.

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:35.090
A fruit feared so much by the world government,
that they tried to erase its true nature and

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:36.490
name from history.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:41.630
Luffy has some of the most powerful allies
in the story and is no longer considered as

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:48.780
an underdog, but a serious contender for the
pirate king crown by the entire world.

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:53.760
Slightly ahead of luffy is the other new emperor,
The great jester Buggy the clown.

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:57.560
Buggy is a real wildcard in the story.

00:11:57.560 --> 00:12:03.110
He has failed his way up so much, you can't
really help but wonder if he's not some secret

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:06.690
genius, that is orchestrating things from
behind the scenes.

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:13.460
However, at least as of right now, buggy is
a nobody, who has lied and tricked his way

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:18.790
into a position he doesn't even want to be
in, at the mercy of crocodile and mihawk as

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:22.670
the official leader of the cross guild organisation.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:28.540
Buggy's real bounty should probably be either
10 million berries or 10 billion berries.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.210
Only time will tell.

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:35.410
For now at least, Buggy sits at 3,189,000,000
berries.

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:40.770
His commander and strongest member of the
cross guild organisation is only one rank

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:41.770
above him.

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:47.480
The 'marine hunter' and strongest swordsman
in the world, Dracula mihawk.

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:52.020
Mihawk without any doubt is one of the strongest
10 characters in the entire story.

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:57.460
He is able to fight with basically anyone
and might have been able to become a yonko

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:01.720
himself, if buggy didn't steal the spot by
accident.

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:06.940
Mihawk has been able to spar with shanks and
even surpasses him in in his swordsman skills.

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:13.420
He is sure to have extremely powerful haki,
demonstrated by his supreme grade sword yoru,

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:16.540
that he turned into a black blade.

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:21.440
Mihawk is a bit of a wild card in his own
regard too and whoever ends up having him

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:25.260
as an ally will be a force to be reckoned
with.

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:32.590
Rightfully so, his new bounty after the abolishment
of the warlord system is a proud 3,590,000,000

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.990
berries.

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:40.460
Barely missing the top 5 and the club of the
4 billion bounties is the third current emperor

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:46.660
of the sea and most likely luffy's biggest
rival for the throne of pirate king: Marshall

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:47.660
d.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.420
Teach aka blackbeard.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:56.290
Teach has laid low for years, staying under
the radar and carefully planning his now quite

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:57.610
quick rise to power.

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:02.610
He has assembled a crew of the most dangerous
and powerful pirates in the world, has started

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:09.370
hunting devil fruits for his crew and is the
only known person who has successfully eaten

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.960
2 devil fruits.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:15.910
As one of the biggest threats and most dangerous
people on the planet right now, Teach rightfully

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:22.420
has gained a new bounty of 3,996,000,000 berries.

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:27.410
Also here a few characters that might be somewhere
in this list too, but who's bounty we don't

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:33.620
know yet: Silvers Rayleigh, Rocks D. Xebec,
Shanks' admirals, Blackbeard's admirals, Monkey

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:36.850
D. Dragon, and the golden lion Shiki.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:42.029
Which brings us to the 5 highest known bounties
in one piece and your chance to quickly subscribe

00:14:42.029 --> 00:14:44.000
to the channel if you haven't already.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.340
Because you're awesome.

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:51.550
Just as awesome as the number 5 and probably
most legendary character in the series, the

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:58.740
captain of the red hair pirates and last remaining
yonko of the original 4, red hair shanks.

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:03.230
Shanks has been a very big mystery for the
longest time in the story, and to a certain

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:04.810
degree still is.

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:08.930
However, we now know that he isn't an emperor
for nothing.

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:13.551
As a former member of the Roger pirates, that
has grown up on the pirate kings ship, he

00:15:13.551 --> 00:15:20.660
has spent his whole life training by the side
of the strongest people in the world.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:27.220
He has the strongest haki in the series with
next level abilities to cancel out other peoples

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:31.860
haki and a presence that can even stun a marine
admiral.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:38.130
He is a master swordsman and on top of that
he also has political power and connections

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:40.740
second to no other pirate.

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:45.910
All of that without having eaten a devil fruit
or having even a single devil fruit user in

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.200
his crew.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:56.900
Rightfully so shanks has a bounty of 4,048,900,000,
which is maybe even too low for him.

00:15:56.900 --> 00:16:00.890
The next three places are all held by former
Rocks pirates.

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:06.080
A little big above shanks, probably due to
her time as a yonko is Big Mom.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:08.070
Big mom, is a true force of nature.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:13.430
Not only is she practically indestructible,
she also wields one of the most terrifying

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:16.380
devil fruits that allows soul manipulation.

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:21.570
She has a crew of powerful children of hers
and is a master in intel gathering and political

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:22.570
manuevering.

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:27.120
Even though she has has now been taken down,
for decades she was the strongest woman in

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:31.860
the entire one piece world with a 4,388,000,000
bounty.

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:39.050
In 3rd place is her former crew mate and later
ally, the strongest creature in the world

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:40.360
Kaido.

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:45.720
Another true force of nature and gigantic
size, seemingly invincible with a mythical

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:52.640
dragon zoan fruit that made his powers even
more ridiculous than they already were.

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:55.980
Kaido was feared and respected by everyone.

00:16:55.980 --> 00:17:00.350
His presence along was enough to keep any
other yonko or the government from interfering

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:01.790
in his affairs in wano.

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:06.579
He was convinced he could change the world
and bring about the return of joy boy, which

00:17:06.579 --> 00:17:11.059
ultimatley he did, even if he was a terrible
person.

00:17:11.059 --> 00:17:20.929
His brutal methods and colossal power put
him above big mom at 4,611,100,000 berries.

00:17:20.929 --> 00:17:25.209
Which leaves us with the 2 highest bounties
in the story:

00:17:25.209 --> 00:17:31.240
Number 2 is Edward Newgate aka Whitebeard,
the former strongest man in the world with

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:32.820
5,046,000,000 berries.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:42.899
The only person above him is of course the
first pirate king Gol D. Roger, only because

00:17:42.899 --> 00:17:46.490
he found the last island and learned the true
history.

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:50.400
They were at the pinnacle of an entire era.

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:52.460
Two absolute legends.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.909
The strongest and most influential pirates
in the story so far.

00:17:56.909 --> 00:18:05.690
Roger with the number one bounty of 5,564,800,000
berries.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:09.130
So the real question now, is who will surpass
these two.

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:15.409
Two likely candidates are Luffy and Shanks,
and if you want to know why you should really

00:18:15.409 --> 00:18:18.369
not miss out on this video right here.

